  "limits": [
    "This is source preparation, not Zenith gameplay presentation. The current view still omits E rather than substituting a generic projectile.",
    "One enabled black empty emitter in a sound-declaring system is classified as a sound carrier for the inventory; native dispatch/default behavior remains unverified.",
    "All native flags/periods/trails/material overrides and disabled declarations are retained. Their runtime interpretation, E source sounds and saved phase/contact/dash/arrival history remain open.",
    "The PATH resolution is tied to the original uint64 field and exact lower-UTF8 XXH64 candidate, not inferred from an unknown field name. The raw field spelling remains unchanged.",
    "Initial 41-named-texture extraction is preserved with 49 original files. Final source includes the hashed override texture and fifty original files.",
    "V1 browser discovery failed on the Node JSON import. V2 loaded exact arrays but inspection wireframe draws failed due to interleaved backing-array length in the installed Three helper. V3 tests original triangle draws and an exact QA position copy for wireframes. Runtime and assets were not changed for those harness repairs.",
    "The prior two-seed normal smoke is revalidated against current unchanged runtime source. No new cohort or full hundred-seed gate is claimed.",
    "Local cache archives are retained evidence, not Git/offline-pack payload. Native client/effect engine/shader was not executed."
  ]
